## What this round produced

Scenario HF — "HEARTH-FEN / Mosshearth Compost Tunnel CT-6": an 8-tunnel
Phase-II mushroom compost pasteurization block at 58.0 C / 16 pct moisture /
peat-straw-gypsum, 42 t. Three heterogeneous, individually-correct agents —
