- Sidecars: raster spikes 98 == round(140 x 19.5 x 0.036); energy 2254 pJ /
  0.002254 uJ at 23 pJ/spike; excerpt 16 events inside [0, 36000] us,
  neuron_id < {ras['neurons']}, same-neuron gap >=1000 us; excerpt_source independent_lif;
  routing 4 entries with three scar edges' before/after pair; third factor tau 0.88 s
  == 880 ms; gate_snn pools 38/14/4 == round(n x rate x 0.027) each,
  decision MODIFY == safety_decision.decision.
- Pipeline: {pipeline_receipt}

## Novel coverage
The coordination-failure CLASS (plenum-mean certificate of a local
compost-core smolder), the domain (mushroom-compost-tunnel / fenland Phase-II),
the reverse-air pulse probe discriminant, the triple-edge scar with
